          "summary": "<p>财新网09月18日电: 沪指开盘报3891.96点，涨幅0.42%。</p><p>深成指报13563.74点，涨幅1.15%；创业板指报3351.56点，涨幅1.61%；中小板指报8360.29点，涨幅0.95%。</p><p>盘面上，建筑材料领涨，电子、有色金属、电力设备、通信、计算机等板块涨幅居前，农林牧渔领跌，石油石化、煤炭、银行、交通运输、食品饮料等走弱。</p><p>消息面上，习近平就发展先进制造业作出重要指示；商务部表示中美经贸团队正就降税等议题保持密切交流；华为宣布下代芯片昇腾960及NPO超节点产品量产计划，瞄准智能体需求；国家广电总局明确，大力扶持真人剧；金融产品网络营销新规倒计时，“大V”带货全面叫停；黄仁勋表示英伟达明年芯片销量将是今年的两倍。</p><p>撰写：财小智   责编：财小新</p><div class=\"yqzszb\" id=\"yqzszb\"><div class=\"header\"><div class=\"yqzszb-title\"><strong><span>上市公司敏感舆情指数</span></strong><img alt=\"数据+\" class=\"support\" src=\"https://entities.caixin.com/support.png\" /></div><p><em class=\"update-time\">更新时间：2026-09-18</em></p></div><div class=\"yqzszb-list\"><div class=\"list-header\"><div class=\"order\">排名</div><div class=\"others\"><div class=\"stock\">股票</div><div class=\"index\">今日指数</div><div class=\"comp\">较昨日</div></div></div><ul class=\"yqzszb-lists\"><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101001647\"><div class=\"row-order\">1</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101001647\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">外高桥<p><span class=\"stock-no\">600648.SH</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">6.24</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+6.24</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">杨某某等诉外高桥建筑安装建设工程合同纠纷案9月18日开庭厘清项目权责</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101019083\"><div class=\"row-order\">2</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101019083\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">永安期货<p><span class=\"stock-no\">600927.SH</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">6.04</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+6.04</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">永安期货非独立董事马国庆离任，年龄58岁在公司董事和高管中排1/12</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101